              "ev-4342e184b148-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 18,
              "start": 18
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Respondents claim that they can now exercise sovereignty over any plot of land they buy within a vast 300,000\u2011acre tract in Central New York that has long been inhabited almost entirely."
